CHE&_nc_oc=AdnRO68k9c_AdsjuF7sMyO2iDdnjyJUxLO6L6ev408GitX25vyv54HThloZxCJ-zEP8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsyf-hn-a2_KwY5D9PUDAL37TXb42NxtVrvAd6T8wrCyQ&oe=69A6ECAF"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "2031682293901788", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570314_2031682300568454_7181790668181460473_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=26ud3nQdcfEQ7kNvwGSn8uY&_nc_oc=AdmPd9CiyjPBYaA_zvNXxbSELZHfHVLm7n0ohrNXQYZeE76R6UAHUi0EkjEGhqOIcFw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftN0_5w2jbcmOQg9tWuWjWoZPwGkD4VzkVih6fHLFJrtw&oe=69A6BC48"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1182641809455371", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982685_1182641812788704_4892425978473987963_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DQn4EPxuVeoQ7kNvwFOGQDJ&_nc_oc=AdlcfIxLCB-HaJxHXASn509xQu53aB5k4Koo2CdmnS3FMRWBZz61ZrLExRXvQ_IlPHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuGNElph6NqHy36NwTS0KimCHYBpeKUu_SnM-UFY01X_A&oe=69A6CD26"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "16x9-2.png", "id": "7747279352020652", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610710_7747279362020651_5612876263433505548_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jk22s7YnNZ0Q7kNvwGFDYZ9&_nc_oc=AdkgDtxhD1m4jQ-rh6wzTuUtv2ir0dCLVguQKlE3ePq7vJ-zqQcWzVd952RlPs_TsSE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuYv0_GkA_LR01nBu9HsLxE88zxpHDgATB0kOy5esRp4Q&oe=69A6EB1A"}, "display_name": "Void Ninja", "keywords": ["action", "platformer", "runner", "ninja", "void"], "long_description": "Void Ninja is an **action platformer** game that blends runner elements with a unique **\u201cJinba Ittai\u201d locomotion**.  \n\n\ud83d\udc49Gameplay: You're **always on the move and can't stop**. Use your hips and shoulders to steer on the path. Overcome obstacles and clear out enemies.   \n\n\ud83d\udc49**Just one button \u2014 let your body do the rest!*** \nYou don't need to remember million of combinations, or press something to move  - run with the flow.  \n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77  \n\n# Key Features:\n\n- **Unique natural flow locomotion:**   \nInspired by the \"Jinba Ittai\" philosophy, this system ensures perfect unity between player and the game - you simply act as you would in real life  \n\u2796  \n- **Comfort / Motion sickness tested:**  \n 85% of players experienced no symptoms, 10% adapted after 30 minutes, and 5% did not adjust and we prefer not to talk about them  \n\u2796 \n- **Platformer / runner:**   \nFirst-person platforming adventure inspired by a certain blue hedgehog. Intense combats,  adrenaline-pumping jumps and jet-powered flights - this game will keep your heart racing   \n \u2796 \n- **Combat dance:**   \nAs you progress, you'll develop your own unique moves and combos crafted by your skill, not pre-made by the developers  \n \u2796\n- **Level reassembly:**   \nEach time you load a level, it\u2019s generated in a new and unique way   \n\n \n\u2795**21 Level-Stages** designed to test your reflexes, agility, and quick thinking.\n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77 \n\nThis is work in progress version.\n**Share your thoughts, ideas and feedback with us** - let's make the game together.\n\n*rarely its 2 buttons, but you won't confuse them. Only 1 sounds better, right?\n", "short_description": "Void Ninja is an action platformer game that blends runner elements with a unique \u201cJinba Ittai\u201d locomotion system. \n\nLocomotion x Controls. \nJust one button \u2014 let your body do the rest!\nYou don't need to remember million of combinations, or press something to move  - run with the flow & help your enemies to meet your katanas.\n\nStep into the shoes of a hero who races forward through a treacherous void, armed with 2 fast katanas and razor-sharp reflexes."}]}, "developer_name": "Roman Yakimenko", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://void-ninja.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_